  "prefLabel": "Fis 403.02 General Restrictions for Length Limits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 403.02 General Restrictions for Length Limits. Whenever a length limit is specified, the head and tail of the fish shall remain intact while on or leaving the waters of the state.\n\nSource. #6086, eff 1-1-96; ss by #6629, eff 1-1-98; ss by #8442, eff 1-1-06; ss by #10425, eff 1-1-14; ss by #13698, eff 7-26-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 400)",
